---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTAButton from "../../components/CTAButton.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  headline: "Belgian Malinois Puppy Price: What Responsible Buyers Should Understand",
  mainEntityOfPage: "https://alliancek9dogs.com/resources/belgian-malinois-puppy-price/",
  author: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Alliance K9", url: "https://alliancek9dogs.com/" },
  publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Alliance K9", url: "https://alliancek9dogs.com/" },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Belgian Malinois Puppy Price: What Responsible Buyers Should Understand"
  description="Understand Belgian Malinois puppy price, deposits, buyer screening, training costs, and why responsible placement matters more than bargain shopping."
  type="article"
  schema={articleSchema}
>
  <Section
    eyebrow="Price Guide"
    title="Belgian Malinois Puppy Price: What Responsible Buyers Should Understand"
    headingLevel="h1"
    description="Price matters, but responsible buyers should look at the whole picture: genetics, raising, evaluation, support, training plans, and long-term fit."
  >
    <div class="prose prose-invert mt-8 max-w-3xl text-stone">
      <p>People often search for Belgian Malinois puppy price or Belgian Malinois puppies for sale price before they understand what a working-line puppy requires. The purchase price is only one part of ownership.</p>
      <p>Available Alliance K9 puppies are currently priced at $1,500, with homes screened for fit. A $500 deposit may be required to reserve a puppy or placement position after fit and availability are discussed.</p>
      <h2>Beyond the Purchase Price</h2>
      <p>Responsible buyers should budget for veterinary care, food, equipment, training, travel or pickup, safe containment, and ongoing development. A working-line puppy can become expensive quickly if the home is not prepared for structure and training.</p>
      <p>Alliance K9 is focused on placement quality, not quick transactions. The right match helps protect both the puppy and the buyer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <CTAButton href="/puppies/">View Available Puppies</CTAButton>
      <CTAButton href="/contact/" variant="secondary">Ask About Placement</CTAButton>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
